Subject: CPMS I02B Direction-Aware Generation Semantic Refinement

@ [refinement_uuid] ee042293-3afe-438c-a594-09c36e5b67a4

& [RootDraft] is not a published schema document
  + it holds normalized generated root structure without $defs plus its exact same-direction closure
  + I02C later materializes self-contained documents and goldens

& [Universe] is a contract-scoped merge
  + one stable name has one normalized definition per direction
  + equal name and unequal bytes is a collision fault
  + opposite directions never share a cache or reference

& [SourceRevision] is supplied metadata
  + accept only lowercase 40-character or 64-character hexadecimal text
  + never claim the library observed Git or a repository
  + universe fingerprint binds source revision, generator identity, limits, ordered definitions, and ordered roots

& [Normalization] is generated-value only
  + Value cannot retain duplicate object keys, so I02B makes no duplicate-key parser claim
  + untrusted byte parsing and duplicate rejection remain I03 work

& [BaseAndPreparation] are two semantic root identities
  + both currently derive ProcedureToolResponse and may have equal raw schema bytes
  + distinct root-kind domain separation preserves intended-use identity

